    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d120-a1">

                <pb facs="0311" n="277" sameAs="frus:frus1964-68v33/pg277"/>

                <head>Attachment<anchor n="2" xml:id="d120-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1967-05-20T11:40:00-04:00">May 20, 1967, 11:40 a.m.</date>
                    </dateline></opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#bold">Memorandum From the President’s Special Assistant
                            (Rostow) to President Johnson
                    </hi>
                </p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Mr. President:</p>
                <p>Herewith Gen. Taylor raises a real and serious problem.</p>
                <pb facs="0312" n="278" xml:id="pg278"/>
                <p>We thought we had it solved with the Schelling appointment—after great delay. But
                    he’s bailed out.</p>
                <p>Gene tells me he has recommended Franklin Lindsay for the Schelling job; but
                    action apparently awaits Nick’s return.</p>
                <p>I believe it essential that Sec. Rusk
                    understand your personal concern that NSAM 341
                    has not been effectively implemented.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        
                            <hi rendition="#bold">Walt</hi>
                        
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
